,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"wendi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_13","text":"It really is a magic word.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"wendi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_14","text":"It makes you out to be the bigger person, which causes the other person to think about what they've done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"wendi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_15","text":"It's a way to defend yourself while also attacking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_16","text":"Why is it necessary to defend and attack during a conversation?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"wendi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_17","text":"Hmm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_18","text":"Ugh, this is so frustrating.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_19","text":"Where does someone this clueless even come from?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_20","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_21","text":"Does your chin still hurt?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_22","text":"Of course, it does!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_23","text":"I'm letting it slide because you apparently didn't know any better, but if you'd done it intentionally, you'd be six feet under by now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_24","text":"Six feet under? What does that mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_25","text":"Dead! In the ground! Buried!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_m","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_26","text":"But why?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_27","text":"Aaaargh! You're driving me crazy!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_28","text":"Wendi, I've got a proposition.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"wendi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_29","text":"What is it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_30","text":"We toss her out into the open and have her figure it out on her own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_31","text":"She'll either get beaten up or cursed out, and she'll have to learn the hard way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_footstepwalkrun1_05_s_32","type":"Speech","spea